'''Revolutionary Workers' Front''' ({{lang-bl|Frente Revolucionario d'os Traballadors}}) is a [[W:Platformism|platform]] established in 1981 in Balisca. It split from the [[Revolutionary Front]] over disagreements regarding the ratification of the [[South Atlantic Accords]].

